item.description:
Governor of Odisha, Dr. Hari Babu Kambhampati met Prime Minister, Shri Narendra Modi today in New Delhi.
In a post on X, the Prime Minister’s Office said;
“Governor of Odisha, @DrHariBabuK met Prime Minister @narendramodi.
@GovernorOdisha”
Governor of Odisha, @DrHariBabuK met Prime Minister @narendramodi . @GovernorOdisha pic.twitter.com/JAqnKlCENY — PMO India (@PMOIndia) October 1, 2026 ************
MJPS/SS/ST

Governor of Tripura, Shri Indra Sena Reddy Nallu met Prime Minister, Shri Narendra Modi today in New Delhi. 
 
The Prime Minister’s Office posted on X; 
 
“Governor of Tripura, Shri Indra Sena Reddy Nallu met Prime Minister @narendramodi. 
 
@TripuraGovernor” 
 
   Governor of Tripura, Shri Indra Sena Reddy Nallu met Prime Minister @narendramodi.

@TripuraGovernor https://t.co/vUs2a3efPi — PMO India (@PMOIndia)  September 29, 2026  

 
   ******************   

    MJPS/SS/ST

Chief Minister of Delhi, Smt. Rekha Gupta met Prime Minister, Shri Narendra Modi today in New Delhi. 
 
The Prime Minister’s Office posted on X; 
 
“Chief Minister of Delhi, Smt. @gupta_rekha called on Prime Minister @narendramodi. 
 
@CMODelhi” 
 
   Chief Minister of Delhi, Smt. @gupta_rekha called on Prime Minister @narendramodi.

